================================================================================
1. DEFINITIONS
================================================================================

1.1 "Container Format Technology" means solely the binary container layout,
    magic-byte identifiers ("SVCV" and "SICV"), JSON metadata header schema,
    chunked Zstandard (zstd) compression and decompression algorithms, and
    random-access seek-table indexing logic for ".vcv" and ".icv" files.

1.2 "Protected Application" means the AltHub Android application in its entirety,
    including without limitation all Kotlin, Java, Rust JNI wrapper code, Jetpack
    Compose user interface components, themes, local loopback HTTP streaming
    server implementations, multi-host discovery modules, BBCode parsers, build
    workflows, icons, graphical assets, configuration files, and compiled APK or
    shared object ("libalthub_core.so") binaries, excluding only the abstract
    Container Format Technology defined in Section 1.1.

